  "body": "Hey,\r\n\r\nWe are currently working on deploying Synapse in our environment but the Docker Image doesn't contain LDAP support (requires a full OS install to get working). We would like to deploy this to our Kubernetes cluster, and have tested it with this setup, but the lack of LDAP is blocking us. We are currently working on building a custom Docker Repo that will allow us to generate our own images but have hit a snag in that deployment.\r\n\r\nCan you include the deployment of the LDAP feature in the Dockerfile for future builds? We can't be the only ones who would find this extremely useful.\r\n",
